aking → must have collecting  \nThen position 2 must have filmmaking.\n\nSo:\n\nPosition 1: Hobby = collecting  \nPosition 2: Hobby = filmmaking\n\nNow let’s verify all constraints:\n\n- Each attribute value is unique: ✅  \n- Journalist (pos 2) is to the right of adventure (pos 1): ✅  \n- Police-officer (pos 1) ≠ filmmaking (pos 2): ✅  \n\nAll constraints satisfied.\n\nNow answer the questions:\n\n> 1. At what position is the person who watches adventure?  \n→ Position 1\n\n> 2. What hobby does the person who is a journalist do?  \n→ Journalist is position 2 → hobby = filmmaking\n\n> 3. What is the job of the person who watches adventure?  \n→ Adventure is position 1 → job = police-officer\n\n> 4. What is the job of the person who watches thriller?  \n→ Thriller is position 2 → job = journalist\n\nSo answers in order:\n\n1. 1  \n2. filmmaking  \n3. police-officer  \n4. journalist\n\nFinal answer format:\n\n<solution>1, filmmaking, police-officer, journalist</solution>\n\nFinal answer: 1, filmmaking, police-officer, journalist", "logprobs": [{"token": "We", "logprob": -0.07889051735401154}, {"token": " are", "logprob": -0.062073830515146255}, {"token": " told", "logprob": -0.8259408473968506}, {"token": " there", "logprob": -0.20528027415275574}, {"token": " are", "logprob": 0.0}, {"token": " two", "logprob": -0.3927764892578125}, {"token": " people", "logprob": -2.861018856492592e-06}, {"token": " in", "logprob": -0.006152025423943996}, {"token": " a", "logprob": -0.0012449617497622967}, {"token": " line", "logprob": -2.3841855067985307e-07}, {"token": ",", "logprob": -0.00044860312482342124}, {"token": " numbered", "logprob": -0.0287297535687685}, {"token": " ", "logprob": -0.09250985085964203}, {"token": "1", "logprob": 0.0}, {"token": " (", "logprob": -0.01417496707290411}, {"token": "left", "logprob": -1.1920928244535389e-07}, {"token": ")", "logprob": -0.00861463975161314}, {"token": " and", "logprob": -0.10020658373832703}, {"token": " ", "logprob": 0.0}, {"to